            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "carissa anne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've only made this recipe twice. The first time, it came out delicious - using frozen strawberries helped make the wine sauce a little sweeter and fruitier. As a caution - the second time, I overcooked the wine and it turned caramel color and HORRIBLY salty! Wine is one of those things that requires precision."
          },
