            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't necessarily agree with the recipe author that there's anything complicated looking about this or that this will \"wow\" your guests. It basically looks like fresh fruit cocktail, but the wine-sugar-mint combo is a nice twist for a fruit salad. I added some fresh raspberries, and they didn't hold up well in the wine marinade, turned mushy. Served with a small slice of angel food cake, this was a nice light finish to a Sunday meal. We enjoyed it and will make again.",
